---
const whatsappNumber = "817084150288";
const whatsappUrl = `https://wa.me/${whatsappNumber}`;
const instagramUrl = "https://instagram.com/mania.daarte";
const squareClubUrl = "https://square.link/u/maniadaarte";
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-paper-warm border-t border-brand-brown/15 text-brand-brown pt-16 pb-12">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-brand-brown/10">
      
      <!-- Marca & Propósito -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
          <img 
            src="/images/logo-mania.png" 
            alt="Mania da Arte Logo" 
            class="h-10 w-10 rounded-xl object-cover shadow-sm border border-brand-brown/10 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300" 
          />
          <div class="flex flex-col">
            <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-brown group-hover:text-brand-terracotta transition-colors">
              Mania da Arte
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-brand-softBrown font-medium">
              Papelaria Personalizada & Afetiva
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-softBrown leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Ateliê de papelaria artesanal no Japão dedicado a transformar momentos, celebrações e marcas em memórias palpáveis com beleza e carinho.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-paper border border-brand-brown/10 text-xs text-brand-brown">
            <span>🇯🇵</span>
            <span>Atendimento em Português para todo o Japão</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Links Rápidos -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-brown">
          Navegação
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-softBrown">
          <li>
            <a href="#catalogo" class="hover:text-brand-terracotta transition-colors">
              Catálogo de Produtos
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#clube" class="hover:text-brand-terracotta transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>Clube Mania da Arte</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] bg-pastel-rose text-brand-brown px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">15% OFF</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="#como-funciona" class="hover:text-brand-terracotta transition-colors">
              Como Funciona o Pedido
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={squareClubUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-brand-terracotta transition-colors">
              Assinatura do Clube (¥500/mês)
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Atendimento & Redes -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="font-serif text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-brown">
          Atendimento Oficial
        </h4>
        <div class="space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-softBrown">
          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-brand-brown">WhatsApp Japão:</p>
            <a
              href={`${whatsappUrl}?text=${encodeURIComponent("Olá! Vim pelo site maniadaarte.digital e gostaria de um atendimento.")}`}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-brand-terracotta transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-0.5"
            >
              <span>+81 70-8415-0288</span>
              <span class="text-green-600 font-bold">• Online</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-brand-brown">Instagram:</p>
            <a
              href={instagramUrl}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-brand-terracotta transition-colors inline-block mt-0.5"
            >
              @mania.daarte
            </a>
          </div>

          <div>
            <p class="font-medium text-brand-brown">Site Oficial:</p>
            <a href="https://maniadaarte.digital" class="hover:text-brand-terracotta transition-colors inline-block mt-0.5">
              https://maniadaarte.digital
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Rodapé Inferior -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-brand-softBrown/80 gap-4 text-center sm:text-left">
      <p>© {currentYear} Mania da Arte. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
      <p class="flex items-center gap-1 justify-center">
        <span>Criado com carinho e papel especial</span>
        <span class="text-brand-rose">♥</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
